User Story:
As a group creator, I want to associate my group with a country, region, or language so that users can discover relevant groups.

Acceptance Criteria:

The group creator can associate thier group with a country from the db
The group creator can associate thier group with a region from the db
The group creator can associate thier group with a language from the db
These tags should be displayed with the group description
These tags should enable a filter/search system
